message: "If you use the RAIS Framework, please cite it as below."
title: "Responsible AI Startups (RAIS) Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Morris
    given-names: Leah Eliz
    affiliation: "Radical Ventures"
    website: "https://leahelizmorris.com"
  - name: "Radical Ventures"
    website: "https://radical.vc"
abstract: >-
  An open-source framework giving venture capital investors a structured way to assess
  responsible AI practices at early-stage companies that develop or deploy AI. Adapted
  from the internal-audit literature for AI systems (Raji, Smart et al., 2020), and used
  as a case study in the World Economic Forum's Responsible AI Playbook for Investors (2024).
keywords:
  - responsible AI
  - venture capital
  - AI governance
  - due diligence
  - startups
repository-code: "https://github.com/radicalventures/RAIS-Framework"
